 "properties": {
  "name": "גינות העיר (Ginot HaIr) community council",
  "source": "Ginot HaIr council service-map PDF (printed 2021-10-13), ginothair.org.il: union of five closed blue vector paths, affine-fit to the printed ITM grid. Adopted as the production boundary per owner decision 2026-11-17 (issue #529), superseding the municipal community-council layer #37+#39+#46 union (6.097 km2, too wide).",
  "source_url": "https://www.ginothair.org.il/files/Newletter/map_of_dogs_playgrounds.pdf",
  "source_page_url": "https://www.ginothair.org.il/index.php?dir=site&page=content&cs=613&langpage=heb",
  "pdf_creation_date": "2021-10-13",
  "retrieved_on": "2026-11-16",
  "source_sha256": "10dfabe81f8bec0c128bb133e2dd7a4ce7dba7b9e52a6ae8c1d829f25a371112",
  "accuracy_note": "Fit residual measures reproduction of printed grid only, not source map accuracy or boundary currency. PDF is an old service map, not a current authoritative cadastral boundary.",
  "crs_note": "coordinates WGS84 (EPSG:4326); authoritative CRS of source is EPSG:2039",
  "area_km2": 3.147,
  "method": "Union of five closed blue vector paths; affine fit to printed ITM grid labels; EPSG:2039 to EPSG:4326. Not digitized from screenshot.",
  "maximum_grid_fit_residual_m": 0.0001434,
  "geometry_note": "One 13 m2 seam-artifact interior ring from the vector union removed (3-vertex triangle at ITM ~220651,631268 where two source paths fail to meet; verified against the source PDF - the printed map shows continuous boundary lines at that junction and no enclave). The verbatim extraction, with the ring, is preserved in docs/design/council-map-2021-candidate.json."
 },
